msgid "Excited states with equation-of-motion CCSD (EOM-CCSD)"
msgstr "使用运动方程CCSD（EOM-CCSD）计算激发态"

msgid ""
"Excitation energies for singlet states can be computed using equation-of-"
"motion (<nowiki>EOM</nowiki>) approach. For the excitation energies the "
"<nowiki>EOM</nowiki>-CCSD method gives the same results as linear response "
"CCSD (LR-CCSD) theory. Accurate results can only be expected for excited "
"states dominated by single excitations. The states to be computed are "
"specified on an ``<nowiki>EOM</nowiki>`` input card, which is a subcommand "
"of ``CCSD``. The following input forms are possible"
msgstr ""
"单重态的激发能可以使用运动方程（EOM）方法计算。对于激发能，EOM-CCSD方法给出的结果与线性响应CCSD（LR-"
"CCSD）理论相同。只有对于由单激发主导的激发态，才能期望获得准确的结果。要计算的状态在\\ ``EOM``\\ 输入卡中指定，它是\\ "
"``CCSD``\\ 的一个子命令。以下是可能的输入形式"

msgid ""
"Computes the given states. Each state is specified in the form *number.sym*,"
" e.g., 5.3 means the fifth state in symmetry 3. Note that state 1.1 "
"corresponds to the ground state CCSD wavefunction and is ignored if given."
msgstr ""
"计算给定的状态。每个状态以\\ *number.sym*\\ "
"的形式指定，例如，5.3表示对称性3中的第五个状态。请注意，状态1.1对应于基态CCSD波函数，如果给出则会被忽略。"

msgid ""
"computes the first :math:`n1` states in symmetry *sym1*, :math:`n2` in "
"*sym2* etc."
msgstr "计算对称性\\ *sym1*\\ 中的前\\ :math:`n1`\\ 个状态，对称性\\ *sym2*\\ 中的\\ :math:`n2`\\ 个状态，等等。"

msgid "computes states :math:`n1` through :math:`n2` in symmetry *sym1*."
msgstr "计算对称性\\ *sym1*\\ 中从\\ :math:`n1`\\ 到\\ :math:`n2`\\ 的状态。"

msgid "The different forms can be combined, e.g.,"
msgstr "不同的形式可以组合使用，例如，"

msgid ""
"computes states 1-3 in symmetry 1, the second excited state in symmetry 2, "
"and the second through fifth excited states in symmetry 3. Note that state "
"1.1 is the ground-state CCSD wavefunction."
msgstr ""
"计算对称性 1 中的态 1-3、对称性 2 中的第二激发态以及对称性 3 中的第二至第五激发态。注意，态 1.1 是基态 CCSD 波函数。"

msgid ""
"By default, an error exit will result if the CCSD did not converge and a "
"subsequent <nowiki>EOM</nowiki> calculation is attempted. The error exit can"
" be avoided using the ``NOCHECK`` option on the CCSD command (see also "
"CCSD(T))."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，如果 CCSD 未收敛且随后尝试进行 EOM 计算，将导致错误退出。可以通过在 CCSD 命令上使用 ``NOCHECK`` "
"选项来避免错误退出（另请参见 CCSD(T)）。"

msgid "Options for EOM"
msgstr "EOM 的选项"

msgid ""
"Normally, no further input is needed for the calculation of excitation "
"energies."
msgstr "通常，计算激发能不需要进一步的输入。"

msgid ""
"EOM-CCSD amplitudes can be saved using ``SAVE=``\\ *record.ifil*. The "
"vectors will be saved after every refreshing of the iteration space and at "
"the end of the calculation. The calculation can be restarted from the saved "
"vectors, if ``START=``\\ *record.ifil* is specified. The set of vectors to "
"be computed can be different in old and restarted calculations. However, if "
"both cards (``SAVE`` and ``START``) are specified and the records for saving"
" and restarting are identical, the sets of vectors should be also identical,"
" otherwise chaos. The identical ``SAVE`` and ``START`` records can be useful"
" for potential energy surfaces calculations, see section `PES for lowest "
"excited states for hydrogen fluoride <excited_states_with_equation-of-"
"motion_ccsd_eom-ccsd.html#pes-for-lowest-excited-states-for-hydrogen-"
"fluoride>`__."
msgstr ""
"EOM-CCSD 振幅可以使用 ``SAVE=``\\ *record.ifil* 保存。向量将在每次刷新迭代空间时以及计算结束时保存。如果指定了 "
"``START=``\\ *record.ifil*\\ "
"，则可以从保存的向量重新启动计算。新旧计算中要计算的向量集可以不同。但是，如果同时指定了这两张卡片（\\ ``SAVE`` 和 ``START``\\ "
"）且保存和重启的记录相同，则向量集也应相同，否则会导致混乱。相同的 ``SAVE`` 和 ``START`` 记录可用于势能面计算，参见章节 `PES "
"for lowest excited states for hydrogen fluoride "
"<excited_states_with_equation-of-motion_ccsd_eom-ccsd.html#pes-for-lowest-"
"excited-states-for-hydrogen-fluoride>`__\\ 。"

msgid ""
"By default, only excitation energies are calculated, since the calculation "
"of properties is about two times as expensive, as the calculation of "
"energies only. The one-electron properties and transition moments "
"(expectation type, as defined in: J.F. Stanton and R.J. Bartlett, `J. Chem. "
"Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.464746>`__ **98**, 7029 (1993)) can be "
"calculated by adding ``TRANS=1`` to ``EOM`` card. The CCSD ground state is "
"treated as a special case. If ``RELAX`` option is specified on the ``EXPEC``"
" card, also the relaxed one-electron density matrix is calculated for the "
"ground state. (Currently, the relaxed CCSD density matrix through the EOM "
"program is available for all-electron calculations only.) By default, dipole"
" moments are calculated. Other required properties can be specified using "
"``EXPEC`` card. Properties are saved in ``MOLPRO`` variables, e.g. the "
":math:`x`-component of the dipole moment is saved in ``DMX``, its pure "
"electron part in ``DMXE``, transition moment – in ``TRDMX`` (left and right "
"transition moments are stored separately). If ``DENSAVE=``\\ *record.ifil* "
"is specified, excited-state densities are saved to *record.ifil*, otherwise "
"they are saved to the record given in ``DM`` card. If ``TRANS=2``, "
"transition density matrices from/to the ground state will be saved provided "
"that ``DENSAVE=``\\ *record.ifil* or ``DM`` card are specified and nonzero. "
"If ``TRANS=3``, transition moments among excited states are also calculated,"
" and finally if ``TRANS=4``, all transition densities will be saved (note "
"that the last option should be used with caution because the number of "
"densities to be stored will quickly exceed the allowed maximum). For an "
"example see section `EOM-CCSD transition moments for hydrogen fluoride "
"<excited_states_with_equation-of-motion_ccsd_eom-ccsd.html#eom-ccsd-"
"transition-moments-for-hydrogen-fluoride>`__."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，仅计算激发能，因为计算性质大约是仅计算能量的两倍昂贵。可以通过在 ``EOM`` 卡片中添加 ``TRANS=1`` "
"来计算单电子性质和跃迁矩（期望值类型，定义见：J.F. Stanton 和 R.J. Bartlett, `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.464746>`__ **98**, 7029 (1993)）。CCSD "
"基态被视为特例。如果在 ``EXPEC`` 卡片上指定了 ``RELAX`` 选项，还会为基态计算松弛的单电子密度矩阵。（目前，通过 EOM "
"程序获得的松弛 CCSD 密度矩阵仅适用于全电子计算。）默认情况下，计算偶极矩。其他所需的性质可以使用 ``EXPEC`` 卡片指定。性质保存在 "
"``MOLPRO`` 变量中，例如，偶极矩的 :math:`x` 分量保存在 ``DMX`` 中，其纯电子部分保存在 ``DMXE`` 中，跃迁矩保存在"
" ``TRDMX`` 中（左右跃迁矩分开存储）。如果指定了 ``DENSAVE=``\\ *record.ifil*\\ ，激发态密度将保存到 "
"*record.ifil*\\ ，否则它们将保存到 ``DM`` 卡片中给出的记录。如果 ``TRANS=2``\\ ，则只要指定了 "
"``DENSAVE=``\\ *record.ifil* 或 ``DM`` 卡片且非零，就会保存与基态之间的跃迁密度矩阵。如果 "
"``TRANS=3``\\ ，还会计算激发态之间的跃迁矩，最后如果 ``TRANS=4``\\ "
"，将保存所有跃迁密度（注意，最后一个选项应谨慎使用，因为要存储的密度数量会迅速超过允许的最大值）。有关示例，请参见章节 `EOM-CCSD "
"transition moments for hydrogen fluoride <excited_states_with_equation-of-"
"motion_ccsd_eom-ccsd.html#eom-ccsd-transition-moments-for-hydrogen-"
"fluoride>`__\\ 。"

msgid ""
"When properties are needed, the left EOM-CCSD wave functions are calculated "
"first. It is possible to use them as starting guesses for the right EOM-CCSD"
" wave functions. This option is controlled by ``STARTLE`` (default 0). If "
"``STARTLE``\\ =1, left vectors are just used as a start for right vectors; "
"if ``STARTLE``\\ =2, starting vectors, obtained from the left vectors are "
"additionally biorthogonalized to the left vectors; finally, if ``STARTLE``\\"
" =3, also the final right vectors are biorthogonalized to the left vectors. "
"The last possibility is of particular importance for degenerate states."
msgstr ""
"当需要计算性质时，首先计算左 EOM-CCSD 波函数。可以将它们用作右 EOM-CCSD 波函数的初始猜测。此选项由 ``STARTLE``\\ "
"（默认 0）控制。如果 ``STARTLE``\\ =1，左向量仅用作右向量的起始；如果 ``STARTLE``\\ "
"=2，从左向量获得的起始向量会额外与左向量进行双正交化；最后，如果 ``STARTLE``\\ "
"=3，最终的右向量也会与左向量进行双正交化。最后一种可能性对于简并态尤为重要。"

msgid ""
"It is possible to make the program to converge to a vector, which resembles "
"a specified singles vector. This option is switched on by ``FOLLOW``\\ =\\ "
":math:`n` card (usually :math:`n`\\ =2 should be set). ``FOLLOW`` card "
"should be always accompanied with ``EXFILE=``\\ *record.ifil* card, where "
"*record.ifil* contains singles vectors from a previous calculation, see "
"section `calculate an EOM-CCSD state most similar to a given CIS state "
"<excited_states_with_equation-of-motion_ccsd_eom-ccsd.html#calculate-an-eom-"
"ccsd-state-most-similar-to-a-given-cis-state>`__."
msgstr ""
"可以使程序收敛到一个与指定单激发向量相似的向量。此选项通过 ``FOLLOW``\\ =\\ :math:`n` 卡片（通常应设置 "
":math:`n`\\ =2）开启。\\ ``FOLLOW`` 卡片应始终与 ``EXFILE=``\\ *record.ifil* 卡片一起使用，其中"
" *record.ifil* 包含来自先前计算的单激发向量，参见章节 `计算与给定 CIS 态最相似的 EOM-CCSD 态 "
"<excited_states_with_equation-of-motion_ccsd_eom-ccsd.html#calculate-an-eom-"
"ccsd-state-most-similar-to-a-given-cis-state>`__\\ 。"

msgid "Options for EOMPAR card"
msgstr "EOMPAR 卡片的选项"

msgid ""
"Normally, no further input is needed. However, some defaults can be changed "
"using the ``EOMPAR`` directive:"
msgstr "通常，不需要进一步的输入。但是，可以使用 ``EOMPAR`` 指令更改一些默认值："

msgid "where the following keywords ``key`` are possible:"
msgstr "其中以下关键字 ``key`` 是可能的："

msgid "All keywords can be abbreviated by at least four characters."
msgstr "所有关键词至少可以缩写为四个字符。"

msgid "Options for EOMPRINT card"
msgstr "EOMPRINT 卡的选项"

msgid ""
"The following print options are mostly for testing purposes and for looking "
"for the convergence problems."
msgstr "以下打印选项主要用于测试和查找收敛问题。"

msgid "Examples"
msgstr "示例"

msgid "PES for lowest excited states for hydrogen fluoride"
msgstr "氟化氢最低激发态的势能面"

msgid ""
"This example shows how to calculate potential energy surfaces for several "
"excited states using restart from a previous calculation."
msgstr "本示例展示了如何使用从前一次计算重启的方式，计算多个激发态的势能面。"

msgid "This calculation produces the following table:"
msgstr "此计算产生以下表格："

msgid "etc."
msgstr "等等。"

msgid "EOM-CCSD transition moments for hydrogen fluoride"
msgstr "氟化氢的 EOM-CCSD 跃迁矩"

msgid ""
"This example shows how to calculate and store CCSD and EOM-CCSD density "
"matrices, calculate dipole and quadrupole moments (transition moments from "
"the ground to excited states are calculated), and how to use the EOM-CCSD "
"excited state density for Mulliken population analysis."
msgstr ""
"本示例展示了如何计算和存储 CCSD 和 EOM-CCSD 密度矩阵，计算偶极矩和四极矩（计算从基态到激发态的跃迁矩），以及如何使用 EOM-CCSD "
"激发态密度进行 Mulliken 布居分析。"

msgid "Calculate an EOM-CCSD state most similar to a given CIS state"
msgstr "计算与给定 CIS 态最相似的 EOM-CCSD 态"

msgid ""
"This example shows how to force the convergence of the EOM-CCSD program to a"
" state, which resembles at most a given CIS state."
msgstr "本示例展示了如何强制 EOM-CCSD 程序收敛到一个态，该态最多与给定的 CIS 态相似。"

msgid "Excited states with CIS"
msgstr "使用 CIS 计算激发态"

msgid ""
"Excitation energies can also be calculated using the Configuration-"
"Interaction Singles (CIS) method. By default, singlet excited states are "
"calculated. Triplet excited states can be obtained by setting ``triplet``\\ "
"=1 in ``EOM`` card. This method cannot be expected to give accurate results,"
" but can be used for quite large molecules. The states to be computed are "
"specified as in ``EOM``. Setting ``trans``\\ =1 switches on the calculation "
"of dipole transition moments (length gauge), while ``trans``\\ =2 allows to "
"obtain additionally one-electron properties of excited states. By default, "
"dipole moments are calculated. Other required properties can be specified "
"using ``EXPEC`` card. ``trans``\\ =0 and 1 work in direct mode."
msgstr ""
"激发能也可以使用单组态相互作用 (CIS) 方法计算。默认情况下，计算单重激发态。通过将 ``EOM`` 卡片中的 ``triplet``\\ =1 "
"设置为 1，可以获得三重激发态。不能期望此方法给出准确的结果，但可用于相当大的分子。要计算的状态在 ``EOM`` 中指定。设置 ``trans``\\"
" =1 会开启偶极跃迁矩（长度规范）的计算，而 ``trans``\\ =2 "
"则允许额外获得激发态的单电子性质。默认情况下，计算偶极矩。其他所需的性质可以使用 ``EXPEC`` 卡片指定。\\ ``trans``\\ =0 和 "
"1 在直接模式下工作。"

msgid ""
"First- and second-order properties for CCSD from expectation-value CC theory"
" (XCCSD)"
msgstr "基于期望值 CC 理论 (XCCSD) 的 CCSD 一阶和二阶性质"

msgid ""
"[cprop_ccsd] First-order and frequency-dependent second-order properties, "
"derived from the expressions based on the expectation value of a one-"
"electron operator, can be obtained with the ``CPROP`` directive for the "
"closed-shell CCSD method. For first-order properties obtained from the "
"energy-derivative approach see section `expectation values "
"<the_closed_shell_ccsd_program.html#expectation-values>`__. The expectation-"
"value methods utilized in the program are described in the following papers:"
msgstr ""
"[cprop_ccsd] 基于单电子算符期望值表达式推导的一阶和频域二阶性质，可以通过 ``CPROP`` 指令为闭壳层 CCSD "
"方法获得。关于通过能量导数方法获得的一阶性质，请参阅章节 `期望值 "
"<the_closed_shell_ccsd_program.html#expectation-values>`__\\ "
"。程序中使用的期望值方法在以下论文中描述："

msgid ""
"Note that properties obtained from the expectation-value expression with the"
" coupled cluster wave function **are not** equivalent to these derived from "
"gradient or linear-response methods, although the results obtained with both"
" methods are quite similar. In XCC the exponential ansatz for the wave "
"function is utilized for the bra side, too."
msgstr ""
"请注意，基于耦合簇波函数的期望值表达式得到的性质\\ **并不**\\ 等同于从梯度或线性响应方法导出的性质，尽管两种方法得到的结果非常相似。在 XCC"
" 中，波函数的指数拟设也用于左矢侧。"

msgid ""
"For the first-order properties the one-electron operators should be "
"specified in the ``EXPEC`` card, while for the second-order properties – in "
"the ``POLARI`` card. A density can be saved by specifying the ``DM`` card."
msgstr ""
"对于一阶性质，单电子算符应在 ``EXPEC`` 卡片中指定，而对于二阶性质，则在 ``POLARI`` 卡片中指定。可以通过指定 ``DM`` "
"卡片来保存密度。"

msgid ""
"For the first-order properties the option ``XDEN=1`` should be usually "
"given. Other options specify a type of the one-electron density, which can "
"be either the density directly derived from the expectation-value "
"expression, see Eq. (8) of Paper 2, or the modified formula, rigorously "
"correct through the :math:`{\\cal O}(W^3)` Møller-Plesset (MP) order, "
"denoted as :math:`\\bar X(3)_{\\rm resp}` in Papers 1 and 2. In the first "
"case the option ``PROP_ORDER``\\ =\\ *n* can be used to specify the "
"approximation level for single and double excitation parts of the so-called "
":math:`S` operator (see [2], Eq. (9)); :math:`n=\\pm 2,\\pm 3,\\pm 4`, where"
" for a positive :math:`n`: all approximations to :math:`S` up to :math:`n` "
"are used, and for a negative :math:`n` only a density with :math:`S` "
"obtained on the :math:`|n|` level will be calculated. Another option related"
" to the :math:`S` operator is ``HIGHW``\\ =\\ *n*, where :math:`n=0,1`; if "
":math:`n`\\ =0, some parts of :math:`S_1` and :math:`S_2` operators of a "
"high MP order are neglected. Below an example of a standard use of this "
"method is given:"
msgstr ""
"对于一阶性质，通常应给出选项 ``XDEN=1``\\ 。其他选项指定单电子密度的类型，该密度可以是直接从期望值表达式导出的密度（参见论文 2 的方程 "
"(8)），或者是经过修正的公式，该公式在 :math:`{\\cal O}(W^3)` Møller-Plesset (MP) 阶内严格正确，在论文 1"
" 和 2 中记为 :math:`\\bar X(3)_{\\rm resp}`\\ 。在第一种情况下，可以使用选项 ``PROP_ORDER``\\ "
"=\\ *n* 来指定所谓的 :math:`S` 算符的单双激发部分的近似级别（参见 [2]，方程 (9)）；其中 :math:`n=\\pm "
"2,\\pm 3,\\pm 4`\\ ，对于正的 :math:`n`\\ ：使用直到 :math:`n` 的所有 :math:`S` 近似，对于负的 "
":math:`n`\\ ，则仅计算在 :math:`|n|` 级别上获得的 :math:`S` 的密度。另一个与 :math:`S` 算符相关的选项是 "
"``HIGHW``\\ =\\ *n*\\ ，其中 :math:`n=0,1`\\ ；如果 :math:`n`\\ =0，则忽略 :math:`S_1`"
" 和 :math:`S_2` 算符中某些高阶 MP 项。下面给出了该方法标准用法的示例："

msgid ""
"The combination above is also available by writing ``EXPEC,XCCSD`` after the"
" ``CCSD`` card. A cheap method denoted as XCCSD(3), obtained by a "
"simplification of the original XCCSD formula, is available by setting"
msgstr ""
"上述组合也可以通过\\ ``CCSD``\\ 卡片后写入\\ ``EXPEC,XCCSD``\\ "
"来获得。一种通过简化原始XCCSD公式得到的廉价方法，称为XCCSD(3)，可通过设置"

msgid "or by writing ``EXPEC,XCCSD(3)`` after the ``CCSD`` card."
msgstr "或在\\ ``CCSD``\\ 卡片后写入\\ ``EXPEC,XCCSD(3)``\\ 来获得。"

msgid ""
"In the second case the options ``X3RESP=1`` and the ``CPHF,1`` card (or "
"alternatively the ``EXPEC`` card) should be specified,"
msgstr "在第二种情况下，应指定选项\\ ``X3RESP=1``\\ 和\\ ``CPHF,1``\\ 卡片（或者作为替代，指定\\ ``EXPEC``\\ 卡片），"

msgid ""
"For the second-order properties always the following options should be "
"given:"
msgstr "对于二阶性质，始终应给出以下选项："

msgid ""
"The recommended CCSD(3) model from Paper 4 requires that additionally the "
"``PROP_ORDER=3`` and ``HIGHW=0`` options are specified. Frequencies for "
"dynamic properties (in atomic units) should be given in variables "
"``OMEGA_RE`` (real parts) and ``OMEGA_IM`` (imaginary parts). If one of "
"these arrays is not given, it is filled with zeros. Other options for the "
"second-order properties involve"
msgstr ""
"论文4中推荐的CCSD(3)模型要求额外指定\\ ``PROP_ORDER=3``\\ 和\\ ``HIGHW=0``\\ "
"选项。动态性质的频率（以原子单位计）应在变量\\ ``OMEGA_RE``\\ （实部）和\\ ``OMEGA_IM``\\ "
"（虚部）中给出。如果未给出这些数组之一，则用零填充。二阶性质的其他选项涉及"

msgid ""
"``OMEGAG`` (default 0.3). There are two linear-equation solvers, ``OMEGAG`` "
"is a minimum frequency, for which the second solver (working for large "
"frequencies) is used."
msgstr ""
"``OMEGAG``\\ （默认值 0.3）。存在两种线性方程求解器，\\ ``OMEGAG`` "
"是一个最小频率，当频率大于等于此值时，将使用第二种求解器（适用于大频率情况）。"

msgid ""
"``DISPCOEF=n`` if :math:`n>0`, calculate dispersion integrals for the van "
"der Waals coefficients with operators given in the ``POLARI`` card, using "
":math:`n` as a number of frequencies for the numerical integration. In this "
"case the frequency values given in ``OMEGA_RE`` and ``OMEGA_IM`` are "
"ignored. If two molecules are calculated in the same script one after "
"another, also the mixed dispersion integrals are calculated. The isotropic "
":math:`C_6` coefficient is stored in a variable ``DISPC6``, the isotropic "
":math:`C_9` nonadditive coefficient – in a variable ``DISPC9``. All "
"necessary informations for the calculation of dispersion integrals are "
"written to the ascii file *name.dispinfo*, where *name* is the name of the "
"``MOLPRO`` script."
msgstr ""
"``DISPCOEF=n`` 如果 :math:`n>0`\\ ，则使用 ``POLARI`` 卡片中给出的算符计算范德华系数的色散积分，其中 "
":math:`n` 用作数值积分的频率点数。在这种情况下，\\ ``OMEGA_RE`` 和 ``OMEGA_IM`` "
"中给出的频率值将被忽略。如果在同一个脚本中先后计算两个分子，也会计算混合色散积分。各向同性的 :math:`C_6` 系数存储在变量 "
"``DISPC6`` 中，各向同性的 :math:`C_9` 非加和系数存储在变量 ``DISPC9`` 中。计算色散积分所需的所有信息都写入 "
"ASCII 文件 *name.dispinfo* 中，其中 *name* 是 ``MOLPRO`` 脚本的名称。"

msgid ""
"``THRPROPAG`` if given, use this threshold as a convergence criterion for "
"the linear-equation solver for the first-order perturbed CCSD amplitudes."
msgstr "``THRPROPAG`` 如果给定，则使用此阈值作为一阶微扰 CCSD 振幅的线性方程求解器的收敛判据。"

msgid "``<nowiki>EOM</nowiki>, state1, state2, state3, …``"
msgstr "``<nowiki>EOM</nowiki>, state1, state2, state3, …``"

msgid "``<nowiki>EOM</nowiki>, $-n1.sym1$, $-n2,sym2$, …``"
msgstr "``<nowiki>EOM</nowiki>, $-n1.sym1$, $-n2,sym2$, …``"

msgid "``<nowiki>EOM</nowiki>, $n1.sym1$, $-n2,sym1$, …``"
msgstr "``<nowiki>EOM</nowiki>, $n1.sym1$, $-n2,sym1$, …``"

msgid "``<nowiki>EOM</nowiki>, $-3.1$, $2.2$, $2.3$, $-5.3$``"
msgstr "``<nowiki>EOM</nowiki>, $-3.1$, $2.2$, $2.3$, $-5.3$``"

msgid "``EOMPAR, key1=value1, key2=value2,…``"
msgstr "``EOMPAR, key1=value1, key2=value2,…``"

msgid ""
"**``MAXDAV``\\ =\\ *nv*** Maximum value of expansion vectors per state in "
"Davidson procedure (default 20)."
msgstr "**``MAXDAV``\\ =\\ *\\ nv*** Davidson 过程中每个态的展开向量最大数目（默认 20）。"

msgid ""
"**``INISINGL``\\ =\\ *ns*** Number of singly excited configurations to be "
"included in initial Hamiltonian (default 20; the configurations are ordered "
"according to their energy). Sometimes ``INISINGL`` should be put to zero in "
"order to catch states dominated by double excitations."
msgstr ""
"**``INISINGL``\\ =\\ *\\ ns*** 包含在初始哈密顿量中的单激发组态数（默认 20；组态按其能量排序）。有时应将 "
"``INISINGL`` 设为零，以便捕获由双激发主导的态。"

msgid ""
"**``INIDOUBL``\\ =\\ *nd*** Number of doubly excited configurations to be "
"included in initial Hamiltonian (default 10)."
msgstr "**``INIDOUBL``\\ =\\ *\\ nd*** 包含在初始哈密顿量中的双激发组态数（默认 10）。"

msgid ""
"**``INIMAX``\\ =\\ *nmax*** Maximum number of excited configurations to be "
"included in initial Hamiltonian. By default, :math:`nmax=ns+nd`."
msgstr ""
"**``INIMAX``\\ =\\ *\\ nmax*** 包含在初始哈密顿量中的激发组态最大数目。默认情况下，\\ "
":math:`nmax=ns+nd`\\ 。"

msgid ""
"**``MAXITER``\\ =\\ *itmax*** Maximum number of iterations in EOM-CCSD "
"(default 50)."
msgstr "**``MAXITER``\\ =\\ *\\ itmax*** EOM-CCSD 中的最大迭代次数（默认 50）。"

msgid ""
"**``MAXEXTRA``\\ =\\ *maxex*** Maximum number of extra configurations "
"allowed to be included in initial Hamiltonian (default 0). In the case of "
"near degeneracy it is better to include a few extra configurations to avoid "
"a slow convergence."
msgstr ""
"**``MAXEXTRA``\\ =\\ *\\ maxex*** 允许包含在初始哈密顿量中的额外组态最大数目（默认 "
"0）。在近简并的情况下，最好包含少量额外组态以避免收敛缓慢。"

msgid ""
"**``EOMLOCAL``\\ =\\ *eoml*** If set to 0, non-local calculation (default). "
"``EOMLOCAL``\\ =1 switches on the local module (experimental!)."
msgstr ""
"**``EOMLOCAL``\\ =\\ *\\ eoml*** 若设为 0，则进行非局域计算（默认）。\\ ``EOMLOCAL``\\ =1 "
"开启局域模块（实验性！）。"

msgid ""
"**``INIMAX``\\ =\\ *ini*** Number of CSFs included in initial Hamiltonian, "
"used only if ``INISINGL`` and ``INIDOUBL`` are both zero."
msgstr ""
"**``INIMAX``\\ =\\ *\\ ini*** 包含在初始哈密顿量中的 CSF 数目，仅在 ``INISINGL`` 和 "
"``INIDOUBL`` 均为零时使用。"

msgid "``EOMPRINT, key1=value1, key2=value2,…``"
msgstr "``EOMPRINT, key1=value1, key2=value2,…``"

msgid "**``DAVIDSON``\\ =\\ *ipr*** Information about Davidson procedure:"
msgstr "**``DAVIDSON``\\ =\\ *\\ ipr*** 关于 Davidson 过程的信息："

msgid ""
"*ipr=1* print results of each \"small diagonalization\" *ipr=2* also print "
"warning information about complex eigenvalues *ipr=3* also print hamiltonian"
" and overlap matrix in trial space."
msgstr ""
"*ipr=1* 打印每次“小对角化”的结果 *ipr=2* 还打印关于复特征值的警告信息 *ipr=3* 还打印试探空间中的哈密顿量和重叠矩阵。"

msgid "**``DIAGONAL``\\ =\\ *ipr*** Information about configurations:"
msgstr "**``DIAGONAL``\\ =\\ *\\ ipr*** 关于组态的信息："

msgid ""
"*ipr=1* print the lowest approximate diagonal elements of the transformed "
"hamiltonian *ipr=2* print orbital labels of important configurations *ipr=3*"
" print all approximate diagonal elements *ipr=4* also print the long form of"
" above."
msgstr ""
"*ipr=1* 打印变换后哈密顿量最低的近似对角元 *ipr=2* 打印重要组态的轨道标签 *ipr=3* 打印所有近似对角元 *ipr=4* "
"还打印上述内容的长格式。"

msgid ""
"**``PSPACE``\\ =\\ *ipr*** Print information about the initial approximate "
"hamiltonian:"
msgstr "**``PSPACE``\\ =\\ *\\ ipr*** 打印关于初始近似哈密顿量的信息："

msgid ""
"*ipr=2* print the approximate hamiltonian used to find the first "
"approximation."
msgstr "*ipr=2* 打印用于求第一近似的近似哈密顿量。"

msgid "**``HEFF``\\ =\\ *ipr*** Print information about effective Hamiltonian:"
msgstr "**``HEFF``\\ =\\ *\\ ipr*** 打印关于有效哈密顿量的信息："

msgid ""
"*ipr=2* print columns of effective hamiltonian and overlap matrix in each "
"iteration"
msgstr "*ipr=2* 在每次迭代中打印有效哈密顿量和重叠矩阵的列"

msgid "**``RESIDUUM``\\ =\\ *ipr*** Print information about residual vectors:"
msgstr "**``RESIDUUM``\\ =\\ *\\ ipr*** 打印关于残差向量的信息："

msgid ""
"*ipr=-1* no print in iteration *ipr=0* print energy values + residuum norm "
"(squared) for each iteration (default) *ipr=1* also print warning about "
"complex eigenvalue, and a warning when no new vectors is added to the trial "
"space due to the too small norm of the residuum vector. *ipr=2* also print "
"how many vectors are left"
msgstr ""
"*ipr=-1* 迭代中不打印 *ipr=0* 打印每次迭代的能量值 + 残差范数（平方）（默认） *ipr=1* "
"还打印关于复特征值的警告，以及当残差向量范数过小而未能向试探空间添加新向量时的警告。 *ipr=2* 还打印剩余多少个向量"

msgid ""
"**``LOCEOM``\\ =\\ *ipr*** *ipr=1* prints overlaps of sample and tested "
"vectors in each iteration, if ``FOLLOW`` card is present. Increasing *ipr* "
"switches on more and more printing, mostly related to the local EOM-CCSD "
"method."
msgstr ""
"**``LOCEOM``\\ =\\ *\\ ipr*** 若存在 ``FOLLOW`` 卡片，*\\ ipr=1\\ * "
"在每次迭代中打印样本向量与测试向量的重叠，增大 *\\ ipr* 会开启越来越多的打印，主要与局域 EOM-CCSD 方法相关。"

msgid ""
"**``POPUL``\\ =\\ *ipr*** if *ipr=1*, do a population analysis of the "
"singles part of the rhs EOM-CCSD wave function. By default the Löwdin method"
" is used. The Mulliken analysis can be forced by adding ``MULLPRINT=1`` to "
"``EOM`` card. Note that a more correct (but more expensive) approach is to "
"calculate and analyse the EOM-CCSD density matrix, see section `options for "
"EOM <excited_states_with_equation-of-motion_ccsd_eom-ccsd.html#options-for-"
"eom>`__."
msgstr ""
"**``POPUL``\\ =\\ *\\ ipr*** 若 *\\ ipr=1*，对 rhs EOM-CCSD "
"波函数的单激发部分进行布居分析。默认使用 Löwdin 方法。可通过向 ``EOM`` 卡片添加 ``MULLPRINT=1`` 来强制使用 "
"Mulliken 分析。注意，更正确（但更昂贵）的方法是计算并分析 EOM-CCSD 密度矩阵，参见 `options for EOM "
"<excited_states_with_equation-of-motion_ccsd_eom-ccsd.html#options-for-"
"eom>`__ 一节。"

msgid ""
"**``INTERMED``\\ =\\ *ipr*** Print intermediates dependent on ground state "
"CCSD amplitudes:"
msgstr "**``INTERMED``\\ =\\ *\\ ipr*** 打印依赖于基态 CCSD 振幅的中间量："

msgid ""
"*ipr=0* no print (default) *ipr=1* print newly created intermediates *ipr=2*"
" also print more intermediates-related information"
msgstr "*ipr=0* 不打印（默认） *ipr=1* 打印新创建的中间量 *ipr=2* 还打印更多与中间量相关的信息"

