msgstr "``CPROP,XDEN=1,X3RESP=1;CPHF,1``"

msgid "``CPROP,PROPAGATOR=1,EOMPROP=1``"
msgstr "``CPROP,PROPAGATOR=1,EOMPROP=1``"

msgid ""
"**``STARTT1``\\ =\\ *n*** various start options for the iterative linear-"
"equation solver for the first-order perturbed CCSD amplitudes, the most "
"useful is :math:`n=0` (zero start) and :math:`n=7` (start from the negative "
"of the r.h.s. vector rescaled by some energetic factors dependent on the "
"diagonal of the Fock matrix and the specified frequency)."
msgstr ""
"**``STARTT1``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** 用于求解一阶微扰 CCSD 振幅的迭代线性方程求解器的各种起始选项，其中最有用的是 "
":math:`n=0`\\ （零起始）和 :math:`n=7`\\ （以右端向量取负、并按依赖于 Fock "
"矩阵对角元和指定频率的某些能量因子重新缩放后作为起始）。"
